                                "sense_id": "6792ef46-1378-3731-83f1-f6cc3eeb37a5",
                                "text": "I glanced sideways at him. He was frowning perplexedly, and I drew a deep breath of relief, for the terrible thought that had flashed across my mind was this: that Dr. Bauerstein might have had an accomplice."
                            }
                        ]
